ice line ②\n\n① normal voice (this message is his feeling for his special person)\n「この腕も、脚も、体も、\n血も魂も——全部、君のためにあるんだ。\n\n僕の人生は、きっと最初から君のものだった。\n\nこのステージでの演奏も、君に届いてほしい気持ちなんだ。\nだから……お願い、僕だけを見てて。」\n\n② the female character that he plays on the stage\n「たとえ隣にいられなくても、私の心はずっとあなたのそばにいる。もう、同じ景色を一緒に見られなくてもいい。\nただ――あなたが幸せでいてくれたら、それだけでいいの。\n\nそれでも……本当は、もう一度だけ、あなたの名前を呼びたかった。」\n\nSorry for such a complicated request. Thank you very much in advance 🙏", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shimamura_ko/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3779183, "client_id": 3692649, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/142b5dc3-4448-431a-af62-86ff703ecf09?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1781178970&Signature=Kl6vP4JTh5sLYQoeNKFR8UQB6WBu2I-oZ9nabU5s31tquhnn2x6nBDfucB7PfvEJ64Hb0xikeorj7Iw2W8zfDDOXX3UQ6Cm1KcuZsu6QXMwTolsDrqZgWXYQWIsCQsD~2Qpb5lo5XRlyEQV7V3Zzm~Y4kwR0yxfvMf9K6Q8AjSHzygOvO8iQ33F7m-xCqS9w~CnD0DHGoPFD3b06M8WgH7QVPTYnqIhJIYkgWSqouUb08Gq1DqEBUQusCw5l4R09H8X5c9RFUFmM-nJzL7dnBtoe~0Vqzbw-ctm0Thr4Vi~JUa338B7Xna8D91TcoHz-lnJhbrOzBeQ7wtgTlktPlg__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb2ec4df053b5efc3b152b5a7cd459e", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb2ec4df053b5efc3b152b5a7cd459e, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecb1dfa2946917b2b7735fd0f310529c 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fpr